PURPOSE

Devotion is a local-first notes application. It is published so that people can
use it on their own machines, read the source, learn from it, and improve it.
It is not published to be sold, hosted as a paid service, or embedded in
commercial products. This license reflects that intent, and nothing in this
project should be read as granting more than it says.

