DEPENDENCIES

This software depends on third-party libraries under their own licenses,
including BlockNote (MPL-2.0), TipTap (MIT), Mantine (MIT), Fastify (MIT),
React (MIT), Vite (MIT) and Tailwind CSS (MIT). Those licenses permit use in
this project; they are listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md and their terms
continue to apply to those libraries.

Note on BlockNote: BlockNote's core packages are MPL-2.0. Its "XL" packages —
AI integration, multi-column layouts, and exporters — are dual-licensed
GPL-3.0 or commercial. Devotion implements its own columns, AI layer and
exporters and depends on no XL package. Keep it that way, or the licensing of
this project changes.

